Carried over from langertha karr ticket #63 (orignally created 2026-08-13). See langertha commit 863ab31 / karr #60 for the workaround in Langertha::MCP::Client.

Net::Async::MCP 0.003 (2026-07-12) hardcodes the obsolete Rev-2025-11-25 initialize form (top-level protocolVersion) and sends no _meta on any request. Current MCP::Server 0.15 / Rev-2026-07-28 requires _meta on every request and has no initialize method (server/discover handshake).

Follow-up: report upstream, watch for a fix, then revert call sites in langertha to Net::Async::MCP.
Scope-Entscheidung: Follow-up-Teil (upstream reporten, auf Fix warten, langertha reverten) wird als separates Ticket #2 geparkt. Dieses Ticket hier behandelt nur den Reconciliation-Fix im eigenen Repo.
